.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e2/4gfdrp1hmkdyb0bd6tbjxpoiqdz6vob.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%86%B0%E7%94%B2.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/e/e2/4gfdrp1hmkdyb0bd6tbjxpoiqdz6vob.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />冰甲\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><center><b>&#160;技能类别<br /></b>[职业技能]</center>\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\">&#160;\n<p>（被动）若没有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"物理护盾\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">物理护盾</font></span></span>]，行动开始时，获得<font color=\"red\">20%</font>最大生命值的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"物理护盾\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">物理护盾</font></span></span>]，不可驱散，冷却<font color=\"red\">2</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%BB%91%E6%9A%97%E4%B9%8B%E5%85%89%E5%86%B0%E6%9C%AF%E5%B8%88\" title=\"角色图鉴库/黑暗之光冰术师\"><img alt=\"头像 黑暗之光冰术师.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/3/33/3hlcu2frr2gt95x0vhuhaa85f1ee3j6.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">黑暗之光冰术师</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E